    "rule": "tensor_bytes = (steps + extra_steps) * (tensor_factor * unit + small_tensor_bytes); node_bytes = (steps + extra_steps) * node_bytes * applications; unit = one restart state (E, H, CPML memories, stored PMC faces, pole banks) at the field element size; tensor ADE adds 3 * cells * element size per operator application to unit, with applications = 2P + 1 + iterations * (1 + P) (otherwise 1)"
